theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("2_xf62s")
text = "





Boarding the plane, it was business as usual. 
Just like any other day. 


Sitting packed into your chair, you listen as an 
announcement plays from the overhead speakers. 


“This is your captain speaking, 
It appears we are currently experiencing 
some interdimensional turbulence. 
Please buckle your seatbelt and remain seated.” 


Interdimensional turbulence?
 Did you hear them right? 


You feel the plane suddenly lurch to the side, then up,
 then down into a nosedive. 


Thick green clouds block your view of the sky. 


You start seeing double and your body feels funny.
Something isn't right. 


“Please brace yourselves for an emergency landing!”


With a sickening explosion the plane crashes into 
the ground.


 A splitting pain erupts down your middle.
 It feels as though your body is being split in two! 

You feel yourself…

 both of yourselves,
Once Leroy, now Leonard and Roy, 
being buried deep below the surface. 


 Layers and layers of rock between you 
and the world you knew. 


It seems as if you have been … TORN ASUNDER!"
horizontal_alignment = 1

